              "restructuring the loop -- caught by re-running the exact same test as before, not just a syntax "
              "check. Built a reusable ReportScreen framework (ui_components.py) -- breadcrumb, date-range filter, "
              "summary cards, sortable table, CSV/Excel/PDF export -- and three real reports on it: Financial "
