              "since redefining a function is completely valid Python; py_compile could not have caught this. "
              "Found by re-reading the diff carefully, not by a tool. Sidebar now highlights the active item with "
              "a gold background, matching the mockup. Added the one concrete keyboard-shortcut item requested "
              "directly: global Alt+1 through Alt+7 for instant navigation. Deliberately NOT built: the full "
              "ShortcutManager, Ctrl+K search, table/dialog-level shortcuts, typography/spacing/border system-wide "
