              "action row) rather than removing any real content. Action buttons rebalanced with genuine weight, "
              "not just color -- Open Workspace now takes roughly half the row and a bolder font, Edit is "
              "visibly smaller, Delete is a small fixed-width icon-only outline that no longer competes for "
              "attention. Increased breathing room around the search bar, away from the Notification/Help icons. "
              "Added a subtle warm-gray border to KPI and client cards as the closest achievable approximation of "
