              "identified for the Financial Dashboard), and mstVendor has no PaymentTerms column at all -- so "
              "'Total Paid', 'Outstanding', and 'Payment Terms' from the mockup were deliberately NOT built, "
              "rather than estimated or guessed. No City filter either, since mstVendor has no separate City "
