              "Total Purchases/Blacklisted/Avg Rating -- Preferred and Avg Rating both genuinely computed from "
              "real IsPreferred and Rating fields). Header modernized to match Clients/Projects (search with "
              "Ctrl+K, no Bell/Help). Added real Category and Partner Type filters. Vendor table gained Total "
