              "to the card and every child label, since Tkinter doesn't propagate click events from children to "
              "a parent frame on its own; cards that don't pass on_click behave exactly as before. Navigation "
              "lands on the real list screen rather than a pre-filtered view, since none of those screens "
              "currently accept an initial filter parameter -- stated as a real, honest limitation rather than "
