              "contractor dues') instead of one generic line, applied consistently to both the Top Outstanding "
              "tables and the no-alerts case. Filter-aware navigation (Vendor Outstanding -> Vendors pre-filtered "
              "to Outstanding) deliberately NOT implemented -- it needs new filter UI added to three separate "
